
#basePath Chapter11

::OnContractSelectOpenCh11
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Hey, M.A...
{@Player}   Oh, yeah. I'm alone...
{@Player}   Well, no point sitting around.
{@Player}   A few more contracts and I can finally pay off this debt.&#x20;



::AfterResearchCh11
@trigger 
@when           IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

// Callie calls

{@Callie}   Hey, Clacky! How's that clunker of a ship?
{@Player}   Callie?! I thought you got arrested!
{@Callie}   Ha! They'll have to catch me first!
{@Player}   What happened to Velos?
{@Callie}   Frontier pulled some strings. Our ships got seized and...
{@Callie}   ...Velos Station was shut down.
{@Callie}   So, you still got all those Frontier bots keeping you company?
{@Player}   Nope. Got rid of the lot of them.
{@Callie} Interesting... Good to hear, Clacky!
{@Player}   What are you up to these days?
{@Callie}   Are you trying to hire me? HA HA HA!

// Callie hangs up

{@Player}   That's not what I was saying! ...that would be a disaster.



::AfterSupplyChainCh11
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once


// Locke calls Blaze

{@Player}   Hey Blaze, did you hear about Dorian?
{@Blaze}    I couldn't believe it! I heard he and <i>Callie</i> grew up together!
{@Player}   Seriously?!!
{@Blaze}    Yeah! They both ran away from home, too. Couple of rebellious kids!
{@Blaze}    Speaking of rebellious kids... Keela sent me the configs to get the bots running again in the mines.
{@Player}   Bet you're already ripping out those cheap parts, too...
{@Blaze}    You know me.
{@Blaze}    Need any help with the software on your bots?
{@Player}   ...It's a little late for that.


